title The walls speak Glow and the crop fits -- the lane's first Skate bindings land, and %347 closes Mind's second cross-bench find
prompt Keaton's kg with the fleet six-wide; N=3774 gave earth again and the advance-by-hand turned water's second orbit -- growing-a-language, the exact row for the lane's own return: the Skate bindings written high.
think The binding followed the tree's own gate-desk pattern (src/gate, the tally and mantra exemplars) and two empirical probes shaped it before any desk landed: the worker admits desks by a hardcoded stem allowlist, and the lowerer refuses a nested conditional with MalformedBody -- so the domain's walls speak as THREE ATOMIC DESKS, one law each: gate-skate-kind-ceiling-u32 (eight seated doors), gate-skate-kind-floor-u32 (zero names none), gate-skate-ring-admit-u32 (the 128th seat admits, the 129th refuses). Eight legs GREEN on metal, the malformed plant still refusing, and tools/g/glow_skate_gates_witness.rish seats TWO PARITY ANCHORS -- max_kind = 8 and event_capacity = 128 must read verbatim in their Rye homes -- so neither language can drift alone, the same one-definition discipline the claims family keeps.
think Mind stopped twice more on the same parked pair and sharpened its Image find into a proven tree defect: photo_edits.rye's per_line_bound = 48 was sized by a comment naming adjust's line while crop's four maximum u32 fields render exactly 49 bytes. Widened on the granted word with the worst case COMPUTED in the said-why (4 + 1 + 4x10 + 3 + 1), max_edits_bytes following by derivation, and the hunk witness GREEN over the widened bound. %347 books it CLOSED: the teaching is that a bound's said-why must name the worst case, not a familiar case -- an honest, irrelevant example is what every later reader reads instead of doing the arithmetic.
obs The day ends with the orbit rule having carried two defects ACROSS benches in one evening -- surface-claims and photo-edits, both found by a seat that could not fix them and fixed by the seat that could within the hour. Mind's remaining parked question (SkateCore's phase-two node shape) is genuinely a sitting; its CUSTODY clears now that Image is answered on metal, and the clear-and-rearm paste rides the reply.
